# Whitelist: ignore everything, then allow only our own source.
# This keeps extracted game files, decompiled code and research databases out
# of the repo even if they end up in this folder by accident.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!*.md
!docs/*.png
!src/**/*.rs
!tests/**/*.rs
!assets/config/*.ron
!tools/**/*.py
!tools/**/*.ps1

# Never commit these, even if they match a rule above.
/target/
/extracted/
/research/
/game/
/graphify-out/
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/*.js
